<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co started as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist initiated coverage of HBO &amp; Co with a buy recommendation, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- In early Nasdaq trade, the shares rose two to 65.</p>
